/**
 * A property's value as a facade shows it: a handle's facade, borrowed (the facade never acquired it), an array of
 * handles their facades, borrowed (`Listed`), else upstream's value with the secret at each path of `S` as `Redacted`
 * at any depth (`ConcealedIn`).
 */
